>> rz58|RZ58| Micropolis 1.2GB Winchester:\
>>   :ty=winchester:ns#84:nt#15:nc#2100:\
>>   :pa#32768:ba#8192:fa#1024:\
>>   :pb#32768:bb#4096:fb#1024:\
