>>reasons for this.

>>First, the disk needs to be formatted for a DecStation. If that is the
>>case how do I format the disk if I can't get it attached to a device.
>>The second possibility is that the controller on my disk is different
>>than the ones on the disks that people had told me about earlier. If
>>so, does anyone know any good places to buy a new PROM to pop into the
>>disk controller? 

>>thanks in advance for any help, 

