I forgot to mention that DEC's description of the DS700-8 says it is 
for full modem control, and the DS700-16 is limited modem control.

The -8 is ONLY for GESTAPO grade foreign PTTs that DEMAND that you cater to
their obsolete whims. For the rest of the world, the functionality in the
-16 model is more than adequate for use even with out of band flow control
with any modern modem.

